{"seq":1,"slug":"physical-vs-notional-pooling","title":"实体归集 vs 名义资金池","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/cash-pool-structure/physical-vs-notional-pooling","wordCount":2289,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"实体归集-vs-名义资金池\">实体归集 vs 名义资金池</h1><p>集团把分散在几十个主体的资金集中管理，落到银行产品上只有两条技术路线：<strong>把钱真的搬到一起</strong>，或者<strong>只把数字搬到一起</strong>。前者叫实体归集（physical pooling），后者叫名义资金池（notional pooling）。这两条路线在银行协议、账务处理、会计确认、监管资本约束上完全不同，选错一次会连带影响后续所有头寸净额、内部借贷与税务安排，所以它必须是第一个决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>资金池要解决的问题是：同一时点上，A 主体账上有 800 万闲置活期，B 主体从银行借了 800 万短期贷款在付 4% 的利息。集团合并看，这 800 万既是资产又是负债，净头寸为零，但利息是实实在在流出去的。归集的目标就是让<strong>内部资金抵消掉外部借贷</strong>——把 B 的缺口用 A 的盈余补上，只保留集团对外的净头寸。</p>\n<p>两种结构对这个目标的实现方式不同：实体归集真的将资金从 A 划到 B（或划到一个主账户），账面上资产负债发生了转移；名义资金池不划款，只是让银行按合并后的净头寸计息，各主体账面余额原封不动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[集团各成员账户] --&gt; B{是否需要真实的资金划转}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[实体归集 Physical]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[名义资金池 Notional]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[零余额账户 ZBA]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[目标余额 Target Balance]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[主账户 Sweep]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[银行按净头寸计息]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[各主体账面余额不变]&#10;    C1 --&gt; E[资金所有权与债权债务发生转移]&#10;    D2 --&gt; F[银行承担毛敞口 但只对净额计息]\">graph TD\n    A[集团各成员账户] --&gt; B{是否需要真实的资金划转}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[实体归集 Physical]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[名义资金池 Notional]\n    C --&gt; C1[零余额账户 ZBA]\n    C --&gt; C2[目标余额 Target Balance]\n    C --&gt; C3[主账户 Sweep]\n    D --&gt; D1[银行按净头寸计息]\n    D --&gt; D2[各主体账面余额不变]\n    C1 --&gt; E[资金所有权与债权债务发生转移]\n    D2 --&gt; F[银行承担毛敞口 但只对净额计息]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>实体归集（Physical）</th>\n<th>名义资金池（Notional）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资金是否划转</td>\n<td>是，日终真实划转</td>\n<td>否，仅计息层面合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>各主体账面余额</td>\n<td>被清零或调到目标值</td>\n<td>保持原样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主体间法律关系</td>\n<td>产生内部债权债务</td>\n<td>通常不产生（银行视角）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行信用敞口</td>\n<td>集中于主账户</td>\n<td>按各账户毛额承担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨境可行性</td>\n<td>受资本项目管制限制大</td>\n<td>受当地法规与银行政策限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会计处理</td>\n<td>资金真实转移，易追溯</td>\n<td>依赖抵销确认条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>多数跨境集团、需内部计息</td>\n<td>同一法域、同一银行、法规允许</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两种结构可以并存：集团常在境内同一法域用法域内的名义池，跨境层面用实体归集，两套结构再通过一个主账户嫁接。这个混合形态是后面<a href=\"crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory\">跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束</a>讨论的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实体归集-零余额账户与目标余额\">实体归集：零余额账户与目标余额</h2><p>实体归集最常用的实现是零余额账户（Zero Balance Account，ZBA）。子账户日终余额被自动划转到主账户，子账户次日以零（或约定的最小额）开始。这样集团只保留一个对外可见的资金池主账户，其余账户纯粹是操作通道。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归集的三种触发形态\">归集的三种触发形态</h3><p><strong>日终归集（end-of-day sweep）</strong> 是默认形态：在银行截止时间前把子账户余额归到主账户，产生一次真实转账。<strong>目标余额（target balance）</strong> 则给子账户留一个固定额度，超过部分上划、不足部分下拨，好处是子账户不必每次重新获得资金，减少了往返划款。<strong>日间归集或余额补偿（intraday / balance compensation）</strong> 不产生真实转账，只在日间授信上做合并计算，本质上已接近名义池。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;poolId&quot;: &quot;EU-MAIN-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;structure&quot;: &quot;physical&quot;,&#10;  &quot;sweep&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;target_balance&quot;,&#10;    &quot;direction&quot;: &quot;zero_balance&quot;,&#10;    &quot;cutoff&quot;: &quot;16:30&quot;,&#10;    &quot;timezone&quot;: &quot;Europe/Amsterdam&quot;,&#10;    &quot;minTransferAmount&quot;: 5000,&#10;    &quot;roundTo&quot;: 1000&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;participants&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;entity&quot;: &quot;NL-OPCO&quot;, &quot;account&quot;: &quot;NL91XXXX&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: 0 },&#10;    { &quot;entity&quot;: &quot;DE-OPCO&quot;, &quot;account&quot;: &quot;DE89XXXX&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: 250000 },&#10;    { &quot;entity&quot;: &quot;FR-OPCO&quot;, &quot;account&quot;: &quot;FR76XXXX&quot;, &quot;target&quot;: 250000 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;interest&quot;: { &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;internal&quot;, &quot;accrual&quot;: &quot;actual/360&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"poolId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU-MAIN-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"structure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"physical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sweep\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"target_balance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"direction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"zero_balance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"cutoff\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"16:30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"timezone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Europe/Amsterdam\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"minTransferAmount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"roundTo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"participants\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"entity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL-OPCO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"account\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL91XXXX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"entity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE-OPCO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"account\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE89XXXX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">250000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"entity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FR-OPCO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"account\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FR76XXXX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">250000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"interest\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"internal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"accrual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"actual/360\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"归集后的账务后果-内部债权债务\">归集后的账务后果：内部债权债务</h3><p>实体归集不是免费的账务动作。A 的 800 万划到主账户后，主账户所在主体对 A 形成一笔负债，A 对其形成一笔债权。如果主账户由母公司持有，那么这笔划转在合并报表层面被抵销，但在<strong>单个法人的报表上</strong>是一笔真实的关联方往来，需要计息、需要符合转让定价与资本弱化规则（详见<a href=\"../intercompany-funding-transfer/intercompany-loan-capitalization\">多实体内部借贷与资本弱化</a>）。这也意味着实体归集自动触发&quot;内部借贷&quot;这一整套合规负担，而名义池通常不会。</p>\n<h2 id=\"名义资金池-计息合并与抵销的边界\">名义资金池：计息合并与抵销的边界</h2><p>名义资金池的全部机制在于：银行把参与账户的余额（含正负）按约定规则合并计算利息，但各账户的资金不被划转。技术上银行按一个虚拟净头寸对集团计息，再把利息按各账户的贡献分摊回去。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计息机制\">计息机制</h3><p>设参与账户余额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（贷方为正、借方为负），存款利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、透支利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则集团日利息为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I = r_d \\cdot \\max\\left(\\sum_i b_i, 0\\right) - r_o \\cdot \\max\\left(-\\sum_i b_i, 0\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键在于<strong>利息由净头寸决定，而净头寸可以远小于毛头寸之和</strong>。这正是名义池的价值：不需要真实划款，却能消掉内部借贷的利差。代价是银行承担的是各账户的毛敞口——如果某天净头寸为正但单个账户大面积透支，银行的信用风险并不因为净额为零而消失。</p>\n<p>利息分摊到各主体时，常见做法是按各账户余额的权重分摊净利息，或先按各自余额独立计息再补一笔净额调节。前者简单但可能让借方主体显得比实际便宜，后者更符合内部计息的可解释性要求，但需要在<a href=\"../intercompany-funding-transfer/fund-transfer-pricing-interest\">内部资金转移定价（FTP）</a>的框架下统一口径，否则同一笔资金在集团内部会有两套价格。</p>\n<h3 id=\"名义池的会计与资本约束\">名义池的会计与资本约束</h3><p>名义池在各主体账上余额不变，所以是否能把多个账户&quot;拉平&quot;成一个净额列示，取决于会计上的抵销条件，而不是银行的计息安排。国际准则要求同时满足两条才可抵销：存在<strong>当前可强制执行的法定抵销权</strong>，以及<strong>意图以净额结算或同时结算</strong>（IAS 32 的抵销条件，见 <a href=\"https://www.ifrs.org/issued-standards/list-of-standards/ias-32-financial-instruments-presentation/\">IFRS Foundation 对 IAS 32 的说明</a>）。名义池协议通常只给银行一个合同抵销权，且该权利在对方进入破产程序时是否仍可执行需按各法域破产法判断，因此多数集团在单体现金流量表上仍按毛额列示。</p>\n<p>银行一侧的约束更硬。巴塞尔框架的杠杆率以 Tier 1 资本为分子、以暴露计量为分母，<strong>最低要求为 3%</strong>；暴露计量一般跟随会计口径，仅对特定情形允许有限抵销——同对手方的证券融资交易可在满足特定条件时净额，与衍生品相关的<strong>现金变动保证金</strong>也可在特定条件下扣减暴露（见 <a href=\"https://www.bis.org/publ/bcbs270.pdf\">Basel III leverage ratio framework</a>）。&quot;现金池&quot;本身并不在这些被明确认可可净额的清单里。这意味着银行给集团做名义池时，往往不能像集团期待的那样按净额降低自身的杠杆率暴露，于是会通过定价、额度上限或直接拒绝跨境名义池来补偿这一成本——这是名义池在跨境场景中普遍难以落地的现实原因之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构选型的判据\">结构选型的判据</h2><p>选型不是技术偏好，而是约束求解。按下面顺序判断：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>指向实体归集</th>\n<th>指向名义资金池</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>参与主体是否跨法域/跨货币</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>当地是否允许跨境资金划转</td>\n<td>受监管限制，需备案</td>\n<td>基本不可行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否需要清晰的内部计息</td>\n<td>天然产生债权债务</td>\n<td>需额外协议构造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银行是否愿意承担毛敞口</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>需要，会反映在价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会计上是否希望按毛额列示</td>\n<td>必然毛额</td>\n<td>可由协议与准则决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实施成本与协议复杂度</td>\n<td>较低，流程标准化</td>\n<td>较高，逐行谈判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中更常见的是<strong>分层</strong>：境内同一法域用名义池消掉利差，跨境用实体归集打通，两者共用一套内部计息口径。跨境那一层受资本项目与额度管理约束，不能自由划转，具体规则见<a href=\"crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory\">跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束</a>；而无论选哪种结构，落地的组织形态通常都是内部银行或收付款工厂，见<a href=\"inhouse-bank-payment-factory\">内部银行与收付款工厂</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实体归集真的划款，产生内部债权债务；名义资金池只合并计息，账面余额不动。</li>\n<li>ZBA 是实体归集最常用的实现，三种触发形态（日终归集、目标余额、日间补偿）在划款成本与资金可用性之间取舍。</li>\n<li>名义池的利息由<strong>净头寸</strong>决定，但银行承担的是<strong>毛敞口</strong>，这一不对称决定了它的定价与适用范围。</li>\n<li>会计上能否按净额列示由抵销条件（法定抵销权 + 净额结算意图）决定，不由银行计息安排决定。</li>\n<li>巴塞尔杠杆率最低 3%，且只对有限情形（SFT 同对手方净额、衍生品现金变动保证金）允许扣减暴露，现金池不在其列。</li>\n<li>选型的现实结论通常是分层：法域内名义池 + 跨境实体归集，共用一套内部计息口径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实体归集 vs 名义资金池","id":"实体归集-vs-名义资金池"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实体归集：零余额账户与目标余额","id":"实体归集-零余额账户与目标余额"},{"level":3,"text":"归集的三种触发形态","id":"归集的三种触发形态"},{"level":3,"text":"归集后的账务后果：内部债权债务","id":"归集后的账务后果-内部债权债务"},{"level":2,"text":"名义资金池：计息合并与抵销的边界","id":"名义资金池-计息合并与抵销的边界"},{"level":3,"text":"计息机制","id":"计息机制"},{"level":3,"text":"名义池的会计与资本约束","id":"名义池的会计与资本约束"},{"level":2,"text":"结构选型的判据","id":"结构选型的判据"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"跨境归集的外汇/资本项目监管约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-treasury-cash-pooling/cash-pool-structure/crossborder-pool-fx-regulatory"}}